{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜聯儲局維持利率不變／西班牙列車相撞最少68死\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-FED-UNCHANGE-261029A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】10月29日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【維持利率不變】美國聯儲局一如預期維持利率不變，主席沃什重申遏制通脹的決心。</p><p>【列車追尾相撞】西班牙兩列高速列車追尾相撞事故，造成最少68人死亡，首相桑切斯宣布全國哀悼三日。</p><p>【皇崗交通安排】萬聖節皇崗口岸高峰時段，公共交通工具將獲優先放行。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.108675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:06.339841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:32.489632+00:00","content_hash":"fc785b5d1598cd12715ddece24b64f5c72fb2c546f198486ab4f758c8bb8ee99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.108675+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}